Six plans include:
Drawing 1 (2 copies): Plans, Elevations and Section Details; 
Drawing 2 (2 copies): Sections, Details and Electrical Plan (one copy also includes a Site Plan);
Drawing 3: Specifications;
Drawing E-1: Electrical Service Feeder, July 9, 1959. (Note on back, "See letter dated 7/28/59 to Matthews from Spencer.")
